abstract: >-
  Public five-class renal-tumor CT benchmark. Training uses UCSF-RMaC
  portal-venous cases. External testing uses RCC-AID and KiTS23. The
  archive contains the frozen fold file and the L0–L4 code, not the
  images or foundation-model weights.
